    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Shopify API-key/admin-token auth is deprecated; use OAuth2 or S2S auth instead"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use Composio's toolkit auth callback as the Shopify OAuth redirect URL"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Custom Shopify credentials keep the same hosted auth UX and Composio still manages refresh"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Shopify OAuth 400s are commonly caused by incorrect client secrets or unverified gated scopes"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Shopify subdomain should be only the store name, not the full `.myshopify.com` host"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use `SHOPIFY_GRAPH_QL_QUERY` for Shopify GraphQL queries"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Fetch more than the default 20 Shopify tools and enable the tool in MCP config"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use `SHOPIFY_GET_ORDERS_WITH_FILTERS` to confirm orders and retrieve order IDs"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Shopify order update 403s can be caused by missing `read_all_orders` scope"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/shopify/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Custom Shopify tools can call GraphQL with Composio-injected auth"
    }
